  "question": {
    "text": "The ratio of powers of two motors is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mi>x</mi></msqrt></mrow><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;that are capable of raising&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;water in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;minutes and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math>&nbsp;water in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;minutes respectively from a well of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;deep. The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;will be",
    "image": null
  },
